    "description": "Grow your career with Haribhakti & Co Holdings Services! We are hiring a Financial Analyst for our Mumbai team. Be part of a workplace that celebrates innovation, diversity, and performance.\n\nAbout Haribhakti & Co Holdings Services:\nHaribhakti & Co Holdings Services is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Prepare and analyze financial statements, reports, and budgets\n• Monitor financial performance against targets and provide variance analysis\n• Implement and maintain internal controls and audit procedures\n• Process payroll and manage employee reimbursements\n• Conduct due diligence for mergers, acquisitions, and investments\n• Prepare annual reports and investor presentations\n• Ensure compliance with tax regulations and statutory requirements\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Bachelor's degree in a relevant field\n• 3-6 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Python for Finance\n• Proficiency in Income Tax\n• Proficiency in Financial Reporting\n• Proficiency in Tally\n• Proficiency in MS Excel\n• Proficiency in Budgeting\n• Proficiency in VBA\n• Proficiency in Risk Management\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Learning & development budget\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Salary Range: 7 LPA - 15 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Mumbai, Maharashtra, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Haribhakti & Co Holdings Services!",
